    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "なんだ、姉貴か。",
            "enText": "Hm? Sis? What do you want?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -2540467978394793271,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "この前の模擬レースで、学園の\r\n月間レコードタイムを叩き出したらしいな。",
            "enText": "I hear you broke the monthly record \nin your last practice race.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3478561231364501093,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "フンッ……タイムなど、どうでもいい。",
            "enText": "Hmph… Who cares about times?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -2469606977916968027,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "レースは勝つか負けるかだ。",
            "enText": "What matters is whether you win or lose.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 991519336544964340,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "そう言うな、数字は自分の成長を測る上で\n理解しやすい要素の1つだ。",
            "enText": "Hmph, nonsense. Numbers provide us \nwith evidence of our growth in a simple \nto understand format.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -5004052679653345761,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "それに、お前を追う者としても参考となる\n数字があった方が目標としやすい。",
            "enText": "And for those who wish to beat your record, \nhaving a concrete time will prove helpful.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -1048654157100328160,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "競い合う相手が欲しいなら、\n常に目標となるタイムを叩き出せ。",
            "enText": "If you truly want a worthy opponent, \nyou should keep breaking records.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 8740282069451150160,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……チッ。わかったよ。",
            "enText": "<i>Tch</i>… Whatever.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -1266885147483803615,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "しかし、数字のことばかり言っていると\n頭でっかちは治らないぞ。",
            "enText": "By the way, all those numbers \nin your noggin? They're the reason \nyour head's so big.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 4983807049500374645,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ビワハヤヒデ",
            "enName": "Biwa Hayahide",
            "jpText": "わ、私の頭はでかくないぞ！",
            "enText": "M-My head is <i>not</i> big!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -6622037936660844871,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1776630701,
    "humanTl": true
}